      "tipo": "explicacion",
      "titulo": {"en": "Pets and farm animals"},
      "texto": {
        "en": "To ask about pets: **¿Tienes mascota?** You answer **tengo un perro**, or **no tengo mascota**.\n\nTalking about a kind of animal in general, Spanish uses the article: me gustan **los** gatos; tengo miedo de **los** caballos.\n\nA fish in the water is **un pez** (plural **peces**). The fish you eat is **el pescado**.\n\nThe same happens with other animals and their meat: **el cerdo** and **la vaca** are the animals; you eat **carne de cerdo** and **carne de ternera**.\n\nFear takes **tener**: **tengo miedo de** los perros."
      }
    },
